Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It appears that village is indeed\Namassing military might
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:09.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and planning something foul!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They may be convincing\NFlowrem to stay there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:14.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so that they can use her as\Na hostage if they need to!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.67,0:00:18.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should begin gathering\Nour troops at once, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We must defeat that village\Nand save Flowrem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:44.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Masshiro hikari no naka me o samashite\Nhajimatteiku sutoorii
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:51.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Fumidasu atarashii sekai donna hana o sakaseyou?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:58.96,Song,,0,0,0,,Kumori sora datte mizutamari de yogoretatte
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.96,0:01:01.79,Song,,0,0,0,,Bokura wa susumu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:08.58,Song,,0,0,0,,Souzou mo shinai mirai ga matteiru kitto
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:12.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Deatte deatte tsunagatteku
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.46,0:01:15.75,Song,,0,0,0,,Waraeba mawari mo egao ni naru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.75,0:01:19.79,Song,,0,0,0,,Chiisana tane maite sodateyou
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:23.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Yagate ookina hana ni naru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:27.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Koukai ya shippai wa kate ni shite
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.38,0:01:30.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Karafuru na shiawase de afureru youni
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.67,0:01:34.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Bokura te o toriatte wakeatte
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:40.71,Song,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu ni hirogatteike Flower Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.42,0:02:15.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to bother you\Nwhile you're looking busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:18.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not just looking busy, I am busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.92,0:02:22.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been put in charge of\Nthe village's accounting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That aside, what brings you here so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The thing is, our princess\Nis gathering troops
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and preparing to go on\Na military campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.54,0:02:36.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our princess is doing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.25,0:02:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why would she do something that absurd?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.71,0:02:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,While you've been gone,\Nsome of her followers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,have taken the opportunity\Nto fill her head with half-truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.92,0:02:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And by followers, you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:49.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The second daughter of the Gritch family,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.13,0:02:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the fourth daughter of the Bugal family,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the second daughter of\Nthe Mamonrose family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.29,0:02:56.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aren't those simpletons the\Ntrio of politically powerful idiots?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.54,0:02:59.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So where exactly are they\Nplanning to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:02.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This village.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are they eating that's giving them\Nsuch ridiculous ideas?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, I've given them\Nplenty of reports, haven't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:10.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They should know how ridiculously\Npowerful this village is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.83,0:03:14.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think the reports were so ridiculous\Nthat they started to seem unrealistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:17.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I tried to have the demon lord\Nput a stop to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:21.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but he's far too soft on his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then do you think it's best\Nif I go convince them to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.83,0:03:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They'd be expecting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would cause them to view you as\Nan enemy of the Demonic Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:34.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:37.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just need you to stop their invasion...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, when are they mobilizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:40.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.21,0:03:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Their forces number 300 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was thinking that maybe if we asked someone\Nfrom this village to rout their forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they'd give up and go home...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:53.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, if we're careless about\Nwhich villagers find out about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it will likely end with the violent\Ndestruction of the Demonic Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:03:58.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That would be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:02.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So basically, I just need to show them\Nthe difference in military might
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.92,0:04:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,without actually mobilizing\Nthe village's forces, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,P-please, spare our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.67,0:04:23.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are we done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.50,0:04:24.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:27.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're really going to give us\Nten boxes of apples just for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you think maybe we should\Npunish them just a little more?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So who are those girls that have been\Nstanding there frozen solid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're from the Demonic Kingdom,\Nand they'd like to move here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They've had a complete change of heart and\Nare all ready to work themselves to death-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, they're ready to work like\Ntheir lives depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.13,0:04:52.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:54.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they kind of seem like they've given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:58.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Almost like they've accepted that\Ntheir lives are over, or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:04:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.54,0:05:01.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're all acquaintances of mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.79,0:05:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so for the time being\NI plan to have them working for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the event that they do anything\Nto harm the village,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:11.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,please don't hesitate to have them\Ndisposed of. I won't mind at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That sounded scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that that's out of the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who's that other girl over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:20.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's here to observe for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:22.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like to show her how things work\Nhere in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-my name is Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:30.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, she was worried about\Nmy living conditions here in our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't need to give her\Nany special treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please put her to work with the\Nunderstanding that she'll be gone soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How does she expect me to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, you can show them around town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:44.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Just leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:46.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.17,0:05:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you all put in some honest work here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:53.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,your transgressions against\Nthe village will be forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That said, I think in the interest of keeping
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,this little incident a secret from\Nthe rest of the villagers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:06:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it would be wise of you all\Nnot to divulge your identities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.33,0:06:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words, Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:03.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:05.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You won't receive any\Nspecial treatment here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.71,0:06:10.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As long as you're in this village,\Nyou'll just be plain old Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:12.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time\Nsince I've been called by my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's get started with\Nour tour of the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So these fruits are turned into alcohol?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These plants grow from inside the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This contraption moves not with magic,\Nbut with the power of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:43.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.33,0:06:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look how fluffy you are! So fluffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:49.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, that tickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These are apples, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had no idea they grew on trees like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, do we have visitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've never eaten apples\Nexcept for at parties at the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I ate them every day at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At my house, we used to have the merchants\Nsearch for them and buy them up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.13,0:07:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,even when they were in short supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:14.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are those girls nobles or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, something like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we can take over this village,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:22.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it'll be the biggest money maker\Nfor our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:23.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dispose!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:25.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-never mind, it's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.25,0:07:29.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.71,0:07:32.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lastismoon of the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:34.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please call me Lasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Lasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.67,0:07:40.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's awfully cute for a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:42.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know we were forced to stay here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:44.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it's still absurd that nobles\Nof the Demonic Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are living in the middle of nowhere like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:48.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll be the laughingstock of\Nthe country when we return.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's wait for a chance and then escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have you learned your lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.00,0:08:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:11.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.13,0:08:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll work like our lives depend on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just please don't dispose of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:18.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're really working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.13,0:08:20.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're actually a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now I can split up the mountain of\Noffice work I had to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.71,0:08:28.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be happy if I can keep them\Nworking like this as part of the town hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:36.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's an inferno wolf, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it alright to be petting it like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:40.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even though a single inferno wolf\Nis said to be dangerous enough
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.63,0:08:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to cause serious damage\Nand harm to any city it enters,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:48.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they're really cute when they're like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to... throw this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.92,0:08:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:02.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll get used to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:04.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This village really has been\Nnothing but surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:14.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't believe a world like this exists\Noutside of the Demonic Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure this is\Na very rare exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:21.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I was just very ignorant\Nof the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I tried to bring war and conflict to\Nsuch a wonderfully peaceful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:29.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyone who takes up arms\Nagainst this place
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,should expect to find themself on\Nthe receiving end of a dragon's fire breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.42,0:09:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed they should.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.33,0:09:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I thought the intel\Nabout dragons living in this village
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.42,0:09:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,was a lie meant to deceive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.17,0:09:47.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I warned everyone not to\Nget involved with this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The demon lord should have\Nwarned you against it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.17,0:09:52.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.17,0:09:55.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:10:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flowrem, you just vanished from\Nthe Demonic Kingdom one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:05.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I heard that you'd become a hostage,\Nand I was worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:07.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Yuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.13,0:10:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop acting like we haven't been friends\Nsince we were children!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:15.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You stopped talking to me\Nwhen you needed help,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.29,0:10:17.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and then before I knew it everything from you\Nwas princess this and princess that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.88,0:10:19.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You treated me like a stranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.25,0:10:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.38,0:10:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll keep you in the loop from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.17,0:10:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:28.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's almost time to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:33.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.38,0:10:39.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This office work is really hard,\Nbut the food here is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We don't have to worry about\Nany stressful political conflicts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:44.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can just relax here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The baths heal my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:50.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was worried that they might\Nhave trouble adjusting to life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:53.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They've already fully adapted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are these the new girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.33,0:10:56.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.54,0:10:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've been at that height\Nall day, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:04.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my transformation magic\Nhasn't really been working.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I'm sure it'll get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:08.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Farming Life...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.96,0:11:11.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in Another...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.29,0:11:12.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,World.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.21,0:11:17.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.29,0:11:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me help out with all the farm work, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:29.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's going to do manual labor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's work for commoners!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.00,0:11:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please stop this, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:34.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wasn't that a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.00,0:11:39.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:43.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then, I want you all\Nto join me and help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:44.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.71,0:11:47.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our specialty is office work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.96,0:11:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll show you how!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I learned a lot from you all\Nduring my time here in this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:18.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm very grateful to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.83,0:12:20.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:22.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I promise to come visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.25,0:12:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're made from the wheat\Nthat we harvested together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to come visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:40.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:42.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you too, mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:45.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Safe travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.17,0:12:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are you all not coming home?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are still things\Nfor us to learn in this village!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And there's still a ton of work to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:13:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We haven't repaid everyone's kindness yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Therefore, we must remain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.79,0:13:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please stop eating\Nat least while you're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.67,0:13:07.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should depart now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.08,0:13:08.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll see you all again sometime, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.63,0:13:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like she enjoyed her time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.79,0:13:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.50,0:13:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Beezel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.29,0:13:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's about Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:30.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ever since she returned to the castle,\Nshe's seemed a bit different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:31.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's like she's grown dignified\Nall of a sudden...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:36.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She looks so busy every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:39.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even if I try to have a conversation with her,\Nshe doesn't really make time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:41.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seems that the princess will begin to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.71,0:13:45.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,take an interest in politics and\Ndiplomacy before too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:49.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Daughters tend to grow into adults\Nbefore their parents realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.33,0:13:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Adults?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.92,0:13:53.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,she met a man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:56.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:14:00.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I, the great demon lord Galgardo,\Nwill tear him apart myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:03.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That attitude is going to make her\Nhate you one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.83,0:14:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.25,0:14:08.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,More importantly, it's time for a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:11.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go and show her\Nwhat a cool father you can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:13.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.63,0:14:15.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:18.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A short while after Yuri left,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.67,0:14:22.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we began our pre-winter crop harvest\Nand this was the result...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When did all this happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:30.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We harvested so much that this here\Nis just what wouldn't fit into storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm happy we had a good harvest, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is a lot more than we were expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.08,0:14:36.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:39.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,would it be alright if we sent\Nsome of the extra to my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can we send some to my parents, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's fine by me, but who are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.88,0:14:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From my perspective,\Nthey're Granddad and Grandmom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.46,0:14:52.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My father lives in the northern continent,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:54.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,while my mother lives in the south,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.79,0:14:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so it's going to be a bit out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're dragons living in\Nthe north and south?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:04.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Might they be the Emperor Dragon Doze,\Nand the Hurricane Dragon Raimaylen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:08.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're exaggerating!\NIs that really what you guys call them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.04,0:15:12.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never imagined the dragons\Nwere all connected like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.29,0:15:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those are some pretty intense names.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.13,0:15:19.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First, Lasty stopped by Dryme's place to\Ndrop off the food we were sharing with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And then she continued on to Shashato City\Nto drop off the crops we were sending there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.42,0:15:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Michael asked her
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:27.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to exterminate a monster that had been\Nattacking the trade vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.13,0:15:29.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.33,0:15:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, guess what!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.83,0:15:37.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I got to take some meat home as thanks\Nfor taking care of that monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is definitely that chanco stuff\Nyou were talking about, mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:43.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That means we're having\Nchanco hotpot tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.75,0:15:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:49.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Hakuren headed north.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.33,0:15:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On her way back, she found some people\Nthat wanted to move to our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.17,0:15:57.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Ya, the leader of this group.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:58.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dark elves?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:02.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? We're referred to as mountain elves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:05.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, that's my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They can all use fire,\Nand they're meat eaters, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.96,0:16:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Normally we live up in the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but as of late, it's become\Nharder for us to find food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.88,0:16:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They seemed like they were\Nhaving some trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.33,0:16:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I thought things might be easier for them\Nif they came and lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:30.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand that no one really has\Nthe leeway to help out strangers these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.38,0:16:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we're causing you any trouble,\Nwe'll leave right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.67,0:16:40.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:44.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was only trying to think up\Na plan in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.63,0:16:46.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to figure out where you'll sleep\Nuntil we build you a house,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.67,0:16:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and other stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about who I'll have to\Ntalk to so I can sort everything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.38,0:16:52.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:53.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.75,0:16:55.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're okay with living here,\Nwe're happy to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.79,0:16:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:02.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're fine sleeping on the ground here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:04.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, we can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:08.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so, the group of mountain elves\Nbecame residents of our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:12.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At the very least,\Nwe'll go catch food on our own!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.25,0:17:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, we're excellent hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:24.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry that we\Ncouldn't be of more use to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:26.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't there something wrong\Nwith this forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think so, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:33.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it's too much for you,\Nplease don't hurt yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.54,0:17:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're very kind, mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's that you're working on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:45.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was hoping it would be possible to\Nmake some pottery in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.21,0:17:46.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:49.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And now, we bake it after it's dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.46,0:17:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:56.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's vanished...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:58.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess the soil here just won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.25,0:18:01.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll have to go look for clay somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:04.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you allow me the honor\Nof finding that for you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We come from the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:09.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and as such, we understand the earth\Nand what lies within it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:10.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But isn't it dangerous\Nto go searching the area?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As long as I don't have to fight,\NI'll be quite alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.21,0:18:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm confident in my ability to flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.63,0:18:20.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just promise me you'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:25.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is great! It's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if we can make\Ncups and plates and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.83,0:18:31.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.13,0:18:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.21,0:18:36.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They found another dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.50,0:18:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. It's a different one\Nthan where the lamia live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.13,0:18:44.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ya found the entrance to the new dungeon\Nup north near the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like your permission to send\Na survey party there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What if it's dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's one reason we need to\Nsurvey the area and learn more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:54.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:58.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just don't do anything too drastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.21,0:19:01.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're heading off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.25,0:19:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,While the survey team was off\Ninvestigating the dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.29,0:19:07.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the men's bathhouse was finally finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.71,0:19:13.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The dwarves and the lizardmen can use it,\Nand so can Dryme when he visits,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.04,0:19:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I definitely didn't build this\Nso I could have it all to myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.29,0:19:17.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:24.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't mind how lively it is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.13,0:19:29.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Remember, you need to make sure\Nto wash yourselves before getting in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.13,0:19:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:33.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What exactly do you all think\Nyou're doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:36.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-we thought this was\Nthe women's bathhouse...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.79,0:19:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't get mad, so tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're about to get\Nreally mad at us, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.00,0:19:46.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, um... we were hoping that maybe\Nwe could wash the mayor's back for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We thought it could be a good chance\Nto get closer to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:54.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're all the absolute lowest\Nranking members in this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.17,0:19:56.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I told you this was a bad idea!\N{\rSubtitle}You can't expect to slip by everyone else{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}and sneak your way to the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:57.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I tried to stop this!\N{\rSubtitle}You can't expect to slip by everyone else{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}and sneak your way to the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.92,0:19:58.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wha?!\N{\rSubtitle}You can't expect to slip by everyone else{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}and sneak your way to the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:19:59.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wha?!\N{\rSubtitle}You know what'll happen{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}if you try something like that, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:01.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know what'll happen\Nif you try something like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.29,0:20:03.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,P-please, just don't let them\Ndispose of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.67,0:20:05.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is your last warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.33,0:20:09.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before long, the dungeon\Nsurvey party had returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.79,0:20:11.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.29,0:20:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're all here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should send an extermination party\Nto the dungeon up north!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.17,0:20:17.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is something there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We confirmed the presence of\Na blood viper inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.46,0:20:24.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, that was the thing fighting the bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.17,0:20:26.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We absolutely must have its meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:30.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The survival of our clan\Ndepends on us getting ahold of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.83,0:20:32.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it really that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.75,0:20:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Blood viper meat is said to be\Nextremely valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:38.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Eating it makes your body\Noverflow with vitality,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.33,0:20:40.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it improves husband-wife relations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.25,0:20:42.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's also said to bless you with children...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.13,0:20:49.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-well, it's almost winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.42,0:20:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's talk it over with the whole village\Nbefore we set out to hunt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.33,0:21:01.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so, autumn faded away\Nas winter began to approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:02.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.92,0:21:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd see you\Nof all people bedridden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:14.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a strange sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:18.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?\NI heard you weren't feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. It's nothing serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:22.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I might have just caught a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.58,0:21:26.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't mixing up different kinds\Nof medicines your specialty?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:29.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've never tried making a medicine\Nfor myself before this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:32.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:35.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just a little bit of nausea\Nand a slight fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.04,0:21:38.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll be fine\Nif I rest for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.58,0:21:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope that's all it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:42.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This might be a long shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.38,0:21:45.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but have you found yourself\Ncraving sour foods lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't really have an appetite\Nbut I'm still able to eat tomatoes and fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.08,0:21:57.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, there was someone in Howling Village\Nwho said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:01.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lulucy, have you really\Nnot figured it out yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.63,0:22:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.33,0:22:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that person?\NWhat happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.67,0:22:10.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We congratulated them on the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.21,0:22:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
